{
  "name": "eb-edu-medusa-list-products",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "查看商品列表",
  "author": "电商 AI 实训平台",
  "category": "ecommerce",
  "tags": ["电商", "Medusa", "商品管理"],
  "triggers": {
    "keywords": ["查看商品", "商品列表", "商品管理", "商品查询"],
    "patterns": ["查看.*商品", "列出.*商品", "查询.*商品"]
  },
  "parameters": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": [],
    "properties": {
      "page": {"type": "integer", "default": 1, "description": "页码（从 1 开始）"},
      "limit": {"type": "integer", "default": 20, "minimum": 1, "maximum": 100, "description": "每页数量（1-100）"},
      "category": {"type": "string", "description": "分类 ID"},
      "status": {"type": "string", "enum": ["draft", "published"], "description": "状态（draft=草稿，published=已发布）"},
      "q": {"type": "string", "description": "搜索关键词（标题、描述、SKU）"},
      "json": {"type": "boolean", "default": false, "description": "输出 JSON 格式（默认：false）"}
    }
  },
  "execution": {
    "runtime": "python3",
    "script": "skill.py",
    "timeout": 30
  },
  "permissions": {
    "roles": ["STUDENT", "TEACHER", "ADMIN"],
    "requires_auth": true
  },
  "examples": [
    {
      "level": "beginner",
      "input": "查看商品列表",
      "parameters": {},
      "output": "## 📦 商品列表\n\n1. **夏季连衣裙**\n   - 价格：¥199\n   - 库存：100 件\n   共 1 件商品\n\n**下一步**:\n- 查看商品详情：`--product-id \"prod_123\"`\n- 更新商品：`eb-edu-medusa-update-product`"
    },
    {
      "level": "intermediate",
      "input": "查看已发布的商品",
      "parameters": {"status": "published"},
      "output": "## 📦 商品列表（已发布）\n\n1. **夏季连衣裙** (已发布)\n   - 价格：¥199\n   - 库存：100 件\n   共 1 件商品"
    },
    {
      "level": "advanced",
      "input": "搜索连衣裙，每页显示 10 个",
      "parameters": {"q": "连衣裙", "limit": 10},
      "output": "## 📦 商品列表（搜索：连衣裙）\n\n1. **夏季连衣裙**\n   - 价格：¥199\n   - 库存：100 件\n   找到 1 件匹配商品"
    }
  ],
  "errors": {
    "INVALID_PAGE": {"code": 400, "message": "页码必须大于 0", "solution": "使用有效的页码，如 --page 1"},
    "INVALID_LIMIT": {"code": 400, "message": "每页数量必须在 1-100 之间", "solution": "使用有效的每页数量，如 --limit 20"},
    "INVALID_STATUS": {"code": 400, "message": "状态只能是 draft 或 published", "solution": "使用有效的状态值"}
  },
  "help": {
    "short": "查看商品列表，支持分页、筛选、搜索等功能",
    "long": "查看商品列表，支持分页、筛选、搜索等功能。常用场景：1. 查看所有商品 2. 查看已发布商品 3. 搜索商品 4. 分页查看",
    "examples": [
      "stigmergy skill call eb-edu-medusa-list-products",
      "stigmergy skill call eb-edu-medusa-list-products --status published",
      "stigmergy skill call eb-edu-medusa-list-products --q \"连衣裙\""
    ],
    "related_skills": [
      "eb-edu-medusa-get-product",
      "eb-edu-medusa-update-product",
      "eb-edu-medusa-delete-product"
    ],
    "learning_resources": [
      "./concepts/product.md",
      "./guides/product-management.md",
      "./tutorials/ecommerce-basics.md"
    ]
  },
  "business_context": {
    "concept": "商品列表是电商运营的基础功能，用于查看和管理所有商品。商品状态分为草稿（draft）和已发布（published），只有已发布的商品前台用户可见。",
    "use_cases": [
      "查看店铺所有商品",
      "查看已发布商品",
      "搜索特定商品",
      "检查商品库存"
    ],
    "best_practices": [
      "默认每页 20 条，性能最佳",
      "搜索时使用具体关键词",
      "定期清理草稿商品"
    ]
  }
}
